{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355680/extras/7b86e13cf94cbce83f03dfcdeb06918a.avif?t=1761175731\" width=592 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysteries, battles, and a magical world that shows no mercy but rewards those bold enough to uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355680/extras/2cb1fc0254ff1f8839f499884a41d63f.avif?t=1761175731\" width=1024 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore semi-procedural biomes and dungeons that evolve with each incursion. <br>Deserts with raging thunderstorms, crystal forests shrouded in dark mist, floating islands torn by typhoons\u2026 Every expedition reveals the unexpected: rare creatures, arcane anomalies, or hidden enemies. <br>Unlock new territories, each more mysterious and challenging than the last.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355680/extras/b191c70397b9f8f4214a73b2f71347d2.avif?t=1761175731\" width=856 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time battles blend reflexes and tactics in equal measure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right moment to strike, defend, evade, exploit the terrain, or expose a weakness, while mastering synergies between abilities and chain reactions. Here, every move matters, and your mind is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355680/extras/a09edf35cb98488a0f8e1429eb1b6db7.avif?t=1761175731\" width=843 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from a mysterious magical event that reshaped the human world, Inv\u00f3kus are both wonder and threat. Wild ones seek only destruction, yet under the command of a skilled Summoner, they may hold the key to humanity\u2019s survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows how many exist... hundreds, perhaps thousands of Inv\u00f3kus await discovery?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355680/extras/30cd8ce1a3b2b08db4d2e914914d5481.avif?t=1761175731\" width=707 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train them, evolve their power, and shape the fate of this world through their strength. Each creature can grow in different ways, unveiling hidden and mysterious evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple evolutionary forms that defy predictability.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Non-linear evolutions, where every choice opens a different path.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Arcane runes that can be forged and infused to enhance their power.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Customized training, adapting their stats to your style.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unique anomalies with rare forms and unseen elemental affinities.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Legacy marks, events that permanently alter their development.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Eternal bond, as every Inv\u00f3kus summoned becomes tied to your soul and grows alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355680?t=1761175731","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355680?t=1761175731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355680/e09e81321e000e37a8b3b1c13fef0a2d8c2711b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761175731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355680/e09e81321e000e37a8b3b1c13fef0a2d8c2711b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761175731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355680/extras/7b86e13cf94cbce83f03dfcdeb06918a.avif?t=1761175731\" width=592 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysteries, battles, and a magical world that shows no mercy but rewards those bold enough to uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355680/extras/2cb1fc0254ff1f8839f499884a41d63f.avif?t=1761175731\" width=1024 height=261 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore semi-procedural biomes and dungeons that evolve with each incursion. <br>Deserts with raging thunderstorms, crystal forests shrouded in dark mist, floating islands torn by typhoons\u2026 Every expedition reveals the unexpected: rare creatures, arcane anomalies, or hidden enemies. <br>Unlock new territories, each more mysterious and challenging than the last.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355680/extras/b191c70397b9f8f4214a73b2f71347d2.avif?t=1761175731\" width=856 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time battles blend reflexes and tactics in equal measure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the right moment to strike, defend, evade, exploit the terrain, or expose a weakness, while mastering synergies between abilities and chain reactions. Here, every move matters, and your mind is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355680/extras/a09edf35cb98488a0f8e1429eb1b6db7.avif?t=1761175731\" width=843 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from a mysterious magical event that reshaped the human world, Inv\u00f3kus are both wonder and threat. Wild ones seek only destruction, yet under the command of a skilled Summoner, they may hold the key to humanity\u2019s survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one knows how many exist... hundreds, perhaps thousands of Inv\u00f3kus await discovery?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355680/extras/30cd8ce1a3b2b08db4d2e914914d5481.avif?t=1761175731\" width=707 height=257 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train them, evolve their power, and shape the fate of this world through their strength. Each creature can grow in different ways, unveiling hidden and mysterious evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple evolutionary forms that defy predictability.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Non-linear evolutions, where every choice opens a different path.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Arcane runes that can be forged and infused to enhance their power.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Customized training, adapting their stats to your style.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unique anomalies with rare forms and unseen elemental affinities.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Legacy marks, events that permanently alter their development.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Eternal bond, as every Inv\u00f3kus summoned becomes tied to your soul and grows alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["VhanJadeStudi